## Scoring
The run shall be evaluated primarily on two parameters

1. **Waypoints Collected:** This represents the number of waypoints you captured along the way. The run is automatically considered complete when you collect the last waypoint at the starting of the free zone. Remember that you cannot collect the next waypoint before collecting the current one.

2. **Time remaining:** This represents the time remaining out of the total time of 180 seconds after the run started. The remaining time would automatically be considered 0 if the robot collides with any wall.

$$
\text{total\_score} = \left( \frac{\text{waypoints\_reached}}{50} \times 100 \right) + \left( \frac{\text{remaining\_time}}{180} \times 100 \times \frac{\text{waypoints\_reached}}{50} \right) = \text{200}
$$
$$
\text{Bonus 50 marks, if all waypoints_reached = 50}
$$

